delay: 2-25
likelier: a small town; a public act of defiance; the same people still in charge
rarer: a big impersonal system; new people in charge; the person was proven right
times: Uncommon: perhaps 1 in 8 people who openly defied a school, office or council later need it while someone there still remembers (estimate)
scene: The clerk looks at the form, then at {N}, then goes to fetch a supervisor. {Ns} name is clearly known here.
scene W: {N} broke their rules once, believing it was right. Now {N} needs those same rules applied fairly.
scene U: {N} reads the refusal letter twice. It does not say why, but {N} can work it out.
scene B: {N} crossed them once and won. They have been waiting to collect.
scene R: The same smug faces, the same office, the same tone. The old anger rises in {N} as if it were yesterday.
scene G: Old grudges in old institutions run deep, like roots under a road.
- W | apply again by the letter, and appeal through every proper step | v: conformity, security | chance: 69
- U | find the rule they are bending, and quote it back to them | v: self-direction, security | mark: defied an authority | chance: 62
- B | go over their heads to someone higher up who owes a favour | v: power | chance: 72
- R | tell them to their faces they are being petty, and walk out | v: self-direction | mark: defied an authority | chance: 12
- G | let it go; you knew the price when you stood up to them | v: tradition (accepting what is) | chance: 30
- W>R | lodge a formal complaint, to be free of their petty blocks for good | v: self-direction, security | chance: 58
- U>G | go back through the old file and see what they saw back then | v: universalism (seeing both sides), self-direction | chance: 58
- B>W | offer to sit on their committee, and fix it from the inside | v: power, conformity | chance: 58
- R>U | take the whole story to the local paper and see what comes out | v: self-direction, stimulation | closed: approval: going public against an office; backfire: the story turns against the teller | chance: 62
- G>B | outlast them: wait until the old guard retires, then apply again | v: achievement, security | chance: 78
works: The request goes through, and nobody mentions the old business.
works: A new face behind the desk waves {N} through.
fails: The file goes to the bottom of the pile, and stays there.
fails: The answer is no, and it is plain why.

