scene B: Standing up once has made {N} someone people follow. That is a kind of power, and here it is, offered.
scene R: They remember! {N} feels the old fire flare up, brighter than before.
scene G: People shelter by the tree that stood through the last storm. {N} has become that tree without meaning to.
