== years of practice are noticed
tier: echo
stages: young_adult+
age: 20-110
tone: joy
life: work, leisure
horizon: months
roles: mentor, boss, a stranger with standing
earth: years of quiet practice are noticed: a request to teach, a commission, an article, a prize
