- U>G | learn to mend, preserve and grow, as the grandparents did | v: tradition, self-direction | mark: learned a skill | chance: 75
- B>W | bargain with every creditor until the payments are fair | v: security, power | chance: 82
- R>U | retrain for something new, now, while there is every reason to | v: self-direction, stimulation | mark: learned a skill | chance: 63
- G>B | call on the family network, and make sure your branch is looked after first | v: security, power | chance: 67
works: The lean months pass, and the household comes through closer than before.
